@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+# Legacy origin files (`https://app.dailygrind.coffee`)
+
+Deploy these files to the **old** origin. They authorize and announce the move of
+the installed web app to `https://www.dailygrind.coffee/` (the app at the repo root).
+
+| File | Purpose |
+| --- | --- |
+| `.well-known/web-app-origin-association` | Old origin approves the move. Serve it as `Content-Type: application/json`. |
+| `manifest.webmanifest` | Replaces the old manifest. Adds `migrate_to` so installed copies find the new app without the user visiting it first. Has no `id`, so its ID stays `https://app.dailygrind.coffee/`, which matches `migrate_from` in the new manifest. |
+| `migration-bridge.html` | Gives saved `dg:*` localStorage settings to the new origin through `postMessage`. Migration moves only the installation, not origin storage. |
+| `move-notice.js` | Banner for browsers without origin migration. Add `<script type="module" src="/move-notice.js"></script>` to the old pages. |
+
+Keep serving the old origin (or at least these files) until users have migrated.
+The two origins must stay same-site (both under `dailygrind.coffee`).
+To make the update mandatory instead of suggested, add `"behavior": "force"` to the
+`migrate_from` entry in the new `/manifest.webmanifest`.
